293 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (The proposed system, ILHR \(Intelligent Longitudinal Health Record\), presents a structured and decision-aware approach to managing fragmented patient medical data. By integrating longitudinal health record organization with rule-based clinical decision support mechanisms, the system enables lab trend monitoring, drug interaction detection, preventive test reminders, and duplicate test identification. This approach enhances prescription safety, improves chronic disease surveillance, and strengthens continuity of care in outpatient settings. The prototype demonstrates the feasibility of implementing a lightweight, scalable clinical intelligence layer tailored to the needs of evolving digital healthcare infrastructure in India.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
